WEBVTT

00:31:27.246 --> 00:31:32.163
But instead, what everyone thought
was me too to this day, you know,

00:31:32.246 --> 00:31:36.288
so this day, really now, you know,
hundreds of people,

00:31:36.288 --> 00:31:37.871
hundreds of thousands of people
around the world,

00:31:37.871 --> 00:31:40.579
maybe millions of people around
the world are saying,

00:31:40.913 --> 00:31:43.288
I know how you feel because
I felt that way, too.

00:31:43.288 --> 00:31:46.413
And and I'm suddenly not alone
in my grief. Yeah.

00:31:46.954 --> 00:31:48.538
And I'm always shocked by that.

00:31:48.746 --> 00:31:54.246
I am very grateful looking
back on my life.

00:31:54.246 --> 00:31:55.954
And maybe this is synthesized happiness,

00:31:55.954 --> 00:32:02.579
I'm not entirely sure in in terms of what
it has given me in terms of my ambition